Removes: RUNNER-ROLLBACK-DESTROYS-INITLESS
Why: 2.2.2: the Init rollback destroys only systems whose Init completed, also inside the nested runners it tears down

diff --git a/KenseiECS/Systems/SystemsRunner.cs b/KenseiECS/Systems/SystemsRunner.cs
--- a/KenseiECS/Systems/SystemsRunner.cs
+++ b/KenseiECS/Systems/SystemsRunner.cs
